post-it: Blue screen of death
symptoms:
	Blue screen
	Restarts by itself
	Slow computer
checks:
	Bluescreen a moment after the desktop appears
		shows: 2 s after the desktop appears: "A fatal exception 0E has occurred", in silence, then it reboots 6 s later
hardware steps:
	Remove the computer shell
	Take out the hard drive, throw it in the trash
	Get a new hard drive from storage
	Install the hard drive
	Remount the shell
